    },
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100091/1802001000910010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんの話だ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000910020,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "知り合いのSNSが炎上してるの\r\nこの内容だと、しばらくは治まりそうにないわね",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100091/1802001000910020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000910030,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "対応も慣れてないみたいだし\r\nかなりメンタルやられてるんじゃないかしら？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100091/1802001000910030"
  },
  {
    "select": "その人のことが\r\n心配なんだな",
    "nextLabel": "1802001000911"
  },
  {
    "select": "かなは大丈夫なのか？",
    "nextLabel": "1802001000912"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "かばってあげなくて\r\nいいのか？",
    "nextLabel": "1802001000913"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000910040,
    "label": "1802001000911",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "商売敵なんだし、心配なんかしてないわよ\r\nちょっと気になっただけ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100091/1802001000910040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000910050,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "……私もきつい時期があって気持ちはわかるから\r\n追い詰められる前に沈静化してほしいわね",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100091/1802001000910050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、楽しく話せたな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000910060,
    "label": "1802001000912",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "気をつけたって燃えるときは燃えるし\r\n不可抗力の時もあるのよ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100091/1802001000910060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000910070,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "けどまあ、私は色々言われるのに慣れてるから\r\nスルースキルはそれなりにあるほうだと思うわよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100091/1802001000910070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（まぁ、普通に話せたかな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000910080,
    "label": "1802001000913",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "関わってもいない私が下手にかばうと\r\n火に油を注ぎかねないわ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100091/1802001000910080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000910090,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "私の発言に影響力なんてないんだし\r\n何かできるはずだ、なんて期待されても困るわ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100091/1802001000910090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（うっ……しまった。別のことを言えば良かったな……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
